<!-- Seelogd home-screen widget strings — ENGLISH (values-en/).
     Android picks this folder from the SYSTEM language (not the in-app language), so it only
     governs the widget picker name/description, the manifest label and the placeholder text
     the layouts show before the first update. Real widget content follows the app language
     via WidgetLanguage.kt. The default values/ folder stays Turkish.
     The key set MUST match values/widget_strings.xml (enforced by
     __tests__/widgetNativeLanguage.test.js). Avoid apostrophes (they need \' escaping). -->
